  <translations>
    <en>
      <description>Rain Bird 9-SST is a specialised MPR nozzle for a side rectangular strip. It is suitable for narrow bands and perimeter areas requiring controlled water distribution. Approximate coverage is 2.7 × 5.5 m according to the supplied catalogue. Fits compatible Rain Bird 1800/RD1800 bodies; installation orientation must match the area shape.</description>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-h1</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-h1s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Precise coverage for narrow rectangular areas</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p1</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p1s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Rain Bird 9-SST</text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p1s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text> is a fixed-pattern nozzle for narrow strips, end sections and rectangular areas. It provides a defined coverage shape instead of a circular spray that could wet the paving around a lawn.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-h2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-h2s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Coverage dimensions and technical data</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p2s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Technical data: </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p2s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>pattern странична правоъгълна ивица; coverage at 2.1 bar 2.7 × 5.5 m; flow at 2.1 bar 6.5 L/min; operating pressure 1.0–2.1 bar. The 9-SST is designed for a wider side strip. A white filter for the 1800 Series is included.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-h3</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-h3s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Fixed spray pattern and positioning</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p3</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p3s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Adjustment: </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p3s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>the coverage shape is fixed by the model and is not adjusted like a 0°–360° variable-arc nozzle. Position the nozzle in line with the strip; reducing radius by more than 25% is not recommended because it can affect distribution uniformity.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-h4</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-h4s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Compatibility with spray heads</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p4</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p4s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>15-CST is designed for a centre strip, 15-EST for an end strip, 15-LCS and 15-RCS for left- and right-corner strips, and 15-SST and 9-SST for side strips. MPR nozzles are designed for matched precipitation when the correct models are selected.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-h5</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-h5s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Design and correct installation</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p5</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p5s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>For system design: </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p5s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>match strip width and length to the site dimensions. Published coverage and flow figures are measured at 2.1 bar in zero-wind conditions; maintain the required pressure at the nozzle and check the pattern after installation. See </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p5s2</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>category</marks>
          <text>spray nozzles</text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p5s3</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>; also read </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p5s4</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>sprinkler-help</marks>
          <text>sprinkler installation, adjustment and repair</text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>3f5c3d95-ec09-40f7-b5ab-86337b3a362a-en-p5s5</_key>
